  "body": "I reported this in #matrix-dev:matrix.org (permalink [1]). I have a room ``#service:matrixim.cc`` on my HS, then use riot-web to login as guest on matrix.org, and join this room. After I kick this guest, it can still send messages, although it can't see the messages I send anymore.\r\n\r\n[1] https://matrix.to/#/!XqBunHwQIXUiqCaoxq:matrix.org/$148256321716MHCxa:matrixim.cc",
